              <td class="p-3 font-medium">Max service temp</td>
              <td class="p-3">~200 °C (zinc ok, base wire governs)</td>
              <td class="p-3">~200 °C</td>
              <td class="p-3">60–70 °C (PVC softens)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium">Weld-point protection</td>
              <td class="p-3">Poor (zinc burns off at welds)</td>
